---
description: Enforce repository-wide Angular unit-test coverage
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md`. For each TypeScript change under `src/`, add deterministic Jasmine tests and run:

```bash
npm run test:coverage
npm run coverage:check
```

The scope is every application `src/**/*.ts` file (exclude `*.spec.ts`, `*.d.ts`, `test.ts`). Statements, branches, functions, and lines must each be at least 90% for every file and in aggregate. The global Jasmine timeout is 60 seconds. Mock HTTP and external services; do not hide application code with coverage exclusions.
